      ['What is a natural risk?', 'when a hazard (earthquake, flood…) meets people and property', [['an event that is always harmless', 'No. ⚠️'], ['a disaster that is already over', 'Risk is about what could happen. 🔮'], ['just a thunderstorm', 'Not only. ⛈️']], 'Risk = hazard × what is exposed: an earthquake in a city is a major risk.']
